        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi yafuuka kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya, ng'agheza emyaka musanvu egy'obukulu, era yaafuga okumala entangama ya myaka amakumi ana (40) mu Yerusalemu. Eriina lya inhina nga ni Zibia ow'e Beerisheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi yaakolanga ebituufu Musengwa Katonda by'asiima ekiseera kyonakyona Yehoiada kabona kye yamala nga mulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoiada yaamufunira abakazi babiri, yaazaala nabo abaana abalenzi n'abaghala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo nga biwoire, Yoashi yaasalagho okulongoosa eisinzizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaasoloza bakabona n'Abalevi, yaabakoba ati: “Mujenga mu bibuga bya Buyudaaya buli mwaka, musolozenga ku Baisiraeli boonaboona empiiya edh'okulongoosanga eisinzizo lya Katonda waimwe. Era mubone ng'ekyo mukikolaku mangu geene.” Aye Abalevi baalwagho okukikola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.11+EXO.30.12+EXO.30.13+EXO.30.14+EXO.30.15+EXO.30.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 30:11-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kale kyabazinga yaayeta Yehoiada omukulu waibwe, yaamukoba ati: “Lwaki tiwasalira Balevi kuleetanga musolo okuva mu Buyudaaya ni mu Yerusalemu, ogwasalibwagho Musa omugheereza wa Katonda, era mwene gwe yatoolanga ku Baisiraeli olw'okulabirira Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabane ba Athalia, omukazi omubi oyo, baali bamenhie eisinzizo lya Katonda, baingira era baatoolamu ebintu byonabyona ebyagheebwayo okuba eby'eisinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda eryo, baabigha emisambwa Baali.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale kyabazinga yaalagira okukola esanduuku, baagita kuliya gha mulyango ogw'eisinzizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho baalangirira mu Buyudaaya ni mu Yerusalemu mwonamwona, abantu baleete eri Musengwa Katonda omusolo, Musa omugheereza wa Katonda gwe yata ku Baisiraeli nga bali mu irungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakungu n'abantu boonaboona baasanhukira ekintu ekyo, era baaleetanga empiiya baadhita mu sanduuku eyo, okutuusa boonaboona lwe baamalayo omusolo gwaibwe. Kale baakolanga batyo buli lunaku, era baasolozanga empiiya kamaala inho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalevi baatwalanga esanduuku eyo eri abakungu ba kyabazinga babone ekirimu. Bwe baabonanga nga mughezeemu empiiya kamaala, omughandiisi wa kyabazinga ni Kabona Omukulu baidhanga, baadhitoolamu, ate sanduuku baagiizaayo mu kifo kyayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga ni Yehoiada, baagemyanga empiiya edho abo abaalabiriranga omulimo ogw'okulongoosa eisinzizo. Ate abo baapatananga n'abakozi ab'okulongoosa eisinzizo, bano: abazimbisa amabaale, n'ababaadhi, n'abagheesa ebintu mu kyuma eky'ekikomo ni mu kyuma ekigumu einho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakozi abo baalongoosa eisinzizo baaliiza buyaaka, era baaligumya inho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baamala omulimo ogwo, empiiya edhaasigalagho baadhigemya kyabazinga ni Yehoiada. Ate abo baadhigulamu ebintu eby'omu isinzizo, ebikozesebwa mu kusinza ni mu kughaayo ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa: ebintu ebiniokezebwaku obubbaani, n'ebintu ebindi ebya zaabu ni feeza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiseera kyonakyona Yehoiada kye yamala ng'akaali mulamu, abantu baaghangayo mu isinzizo ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa, aghazira kwosaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Yehoiada oyo yaamala yaakairika, era yaafa ng'agheziiza emyaka kikumi n'asatu (130) egy'obukulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamuziika mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi, mu lwambiidhi lwa bakyabazinga, kuba yali akoleire Katonda n'eisinzizo lye ebirungi mu Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoiada bwe yamala okufa, abakungu mu Buyudaaya baaja baakubira kyabazinga amakiryaivu era baakutama n'ebyeni byatuuka ku itaka. Agho kyabazinga yaawulirisa bye baamukoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baava ku kusinzizanga mu isinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa badhaadha baibwe, baira ku kusinzanga omusambwa omukazi Ashera n'ebisinzibwa ebindi ebitali Katonda. Era Musengwa Katonda oyo yaasungughalira Buyudaaya ni Yerusalemu, olw'omusango gwaibwe ogwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaabagheereza abalanzi okubalabula baire y'ali, aye baaloba kwefiirayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho omwoyo gwa Katonda gwaidha ku Zekaria mutabane wa Yehoiada kabona. Yaayemerera ghaigulu abantu ghe bamubonera obukalamu, yaakoba ati: “Musengwa Katonda akoba ati, lwaki mudheemera ebiragiro bye, ni mwereetera akabi? Nga imwe bwe mwava ku Musengwa Katonda oyo, yeena abalekuliire agho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abantu baamukolera olukwe, baamukubira amabaale mu luya lw'eisinzizo, nga baajiira ku kiragiro kya kyabazinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ngeri eyo kyabazinga Yoashi yaaloba kwidhukira ekisa Yehoiada kye yamukolera, yaita Zekaria mutabane wa Yehoiada oyo. Zekaria bweyali ali kumpi okufa, yaakoba ati: “Musengwa Katonda agwananga yaabona kino ky'okoze, yaakwesasuulizaaku.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ng'omwaka guli kuwaaku, ab'eigye ly'Abasiria baalumba Yoashi. Baidha mu Buyudaaya ni mu Yerusalemu, baita abakulembeze ab'abantu boonaboona okubasaaniagho, baatoola n'omunhago gwe baanhaga gwonagwona, baagutwala ye kyabazinga ow'e Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waire ng'eigye ery'Abasiria lyali itono, Musengwa Katonda yaligha okughangula eigye ly'Abayudaaya eryali eikologho lyene kuba abantu b'omu Buyudaaya baali baviire ku Musengwa Katonda, oyo Katonda wa badhaadha baibwe. Kale kyabazinga Yoashi baamubonereza batyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasiria bwe baagolola, baaleka Yoashi oyo nga bamufumiite inho ebibwa. Agho abagheereza be beene baamukolera olukwe, baamutemulira mu buliri bwe olw'okwita mutabane ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mutabane:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekyo n'ekiri mu Lugureki, aye mu Luheburayi mulimu “Batabane”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa Yehoiada kabona. Kale yaafa, baamuziika mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi, aye ti mu lwambiidhi lwa bakyabazinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaakola olukwe okumwita, baali: Zabadi mutabane w'omukazi Omuammoni ayetebwa Shimeathi, ni Yehozabadi mutabane w'omukazi Omumoabu ayetebwa Shimurithi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Byonabyona ebigema ku batabane ba Yoashi oyo, ni ku ebyo abalanzi bye baalanga okumuvumirira, ni ku kuzimba obuyaaka eisinzizo, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo ekiinhonhola ebifa ku bakyabazinga. Mutabane we Amazia n'eyamusikira ku bwakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
